{"id":"f3126eb15a4d7bf1","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-recursive-real-function.md","title":"Recursive Partial Functions with Real Arguments","display":"df-recursive-real-function — Recursive Partial Functions with Real Arguments","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-recursive-real-function","aliases":["68-df-recursive-real-function"],"display":"df-recursive-real-function — Recursive Partial Functions with Real Arguments","depends_on":["[[68-df-baire-space]]","[[68-df-real-machine]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§18 pp.67–69 / PDF 76–78","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"construction-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-recursive-real-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-recursive-real-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursive-real-function — Recursive Partial Functions with Real Arguments"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4bd688e6777d088c\" href=\"?note=4bd688e6777d088c\" title=\"68-df-baire-space\">68-df-baire-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"45acd372bb8b9947\" href=\"?note=45acd372bb8b9947\" title=\"68-df-real-machine\">68-df-real-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§18 pp.67–69 / PDF 76–78"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"construction-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k,r,l\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k,r,l\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal P_m^{\\mathcal B}\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal P_m^{\\mathcal B}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B^m\">\\(\\vec\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B^m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_{m,k}^{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathcal F_{m,k}^{\\mathcal B}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{m,k}\">\\(X_{m,k}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^{\\mathcal B}\">\\(C^{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 见直接依赖。</p>\n<p>偏值比较条款的参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathcal F_{m,k}^{\\mathcal B}\">\\(F\\in\\mathcal F_{m,k}^{\\mathcal B}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathcal F_{r,l}^{\\mathcal B}\">\\(G\\in\\mathcal F_{r,l}^{\\mathcal B}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in X_{m,k}\">\\(p\\in X_{m,k}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in X_{r,l}\">\\(q\\in X_{r,l}\\)</span>；下式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 的图语义，其输入不必属于相应偏函数的定义域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F(p)\\simeq G(q)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl((p,y)\\in F\\Longleftrightarrow(q,y)\\in G\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F(p)\\simeq G(q)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl((p,y)\\in F\\Longleftrightarrow(q,y)\\in G\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_{P,m,k}^{\\mathcal B}:=\\{((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x),y)\\in X_{m,k}\\times\\mathbb N:\\exists t,q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\;(C^{\\mathcal B}(P,k,\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x,t)=(q,\\rho)\\land q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land y=\\rho(0))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_{P,m,k}^{\\mathcal B}:=\\{((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x),y)\\in X_{m,k}\\times\\mathbb N:\\exists t,q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\;(C^{\\mathcal B}(P,k,\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x,t)=(q,\\rho)\\land q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land y=\\rho(0))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m,k)}:=\\{F_{P,m,k}^{\\mathcal B}:P\\in\\mathcal P_m^{\\mathcal B}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{TotalRecReal}^{(m,k)}:=\\{F\\in\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m,k)}:\\operatorname{dom}(F)=X_{m,k}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m,k)}:=\\{F_{P,m,k}^{\\mathcal B}:P\\in\\mathcal P_m^{\\mathcal B}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{TotalRecReal}^{(m,k)}:=\\{F\\in\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m,k)}:\\operatorname{dom}(F)=X_{m,k}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRecReal}:=\\bigcup_{m,k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m,k)},\\qquad\\mathrm{TotalRecReal}:=\\bigcup_{m,k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{TotalRecReal}^{(m,k)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PartRecReal}:=\\bigcup_{m,k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m,k)},\\qquad\\mathrm{TotalRecReal}:=\\bigcup_{m,k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{TotalRecReal}^{(m,k)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §18，印刷 pp.67–69 / PDF pp.76–78。recursive 允许部分函数，因此分开记录 PartRecReal 与 TotalRecReal。机器确定性及停机状态的恒等延续保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{P,m,k}^{\\mathcal B}\">\\(F_{P,m,k}^{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 是单值图。量词为“存在一个固定程序，对全部实输入一致工作”；不能替换为每个实输入分别存在程序。空程序给出全零函数；永远跳转给出空偏函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-baire-space","status":"resolved","id":"4bd688e6777d088c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-baire-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-real-machine","status":"resolved","id":"45acd372bb8b9947","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-real-machine]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"m,k,r,l\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathcal P_m^{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_{m,k}^{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"X_{m,k}","display":false},{"tex":"C^{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathcal F_{m,k}^{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"G\\in\\mathcal F_{r,l}^{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in X_{m,k}","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in X_{r,l}","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq","display":false},{"tex":"F(p)\\simeq G(q)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl((p,y)\\in F\\Longleftrightarrow(q,y)\\in G\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"F_{P,m,k}^{\\mathcal B}:=\\{((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x),y)\\in X_{m,k}\\times\\mathbb N:\\exists t,q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\;(C^{\\mathcal B}(P,k,\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x,t)=(q,\\rho)\\land q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land y=\\rho(0))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m,k)}:=\\{F_{P,m,k}^{\\mathcal B}:P\\in\\mathcal P_m^{\\mathcal B}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{TotalRecReal}^{(m,k)}:=\\{F\\in\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m,k)}:\\operatorname{dom}(F)=X_{m,k}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartRecReal}:=\\bigcup_{m,k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m,k)},\\qquad\\mathrm{TotalRecReal}:=\\bigcup_{m,k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{TotalRecReal}^{(m,k)}.","display":true},{"tex":"F_{P,m,k}^{\\mathcal B}","display":false}],"bytes":2301,"backlinks":[{"id":"3b9d3e17f14fdcab","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$m,k,r,l\\in\\mathbb N$，$R\\subseteq X_{m,k}$，$S\\subseteq X_{r,l}$。$X_{m,k}$、$\\mathcal B$ 见 [[68-df-baire-space]]；$\\mathrm{TotalRecReal}^{(m,k)}$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-real-function]]。$\\langle z_i\\rangle_{i<r}$ 为有限元组，$\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle$ 在数元组末尾添加一个数。$\\le_{\\mathrm{eff}}$ 为下式引入的带元数关系。"},{"id":"ab5b845cf7d367cd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$R\\subseteq X_{m,k}$。$\\mathrm{TotalRecReal}^{(m,k)}$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-real-function]]。特征函数采用 $1$ 为真的约定。"},{"id":"0c57c9ec349151f1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$G\\in\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m+1,k)}$，$H\\in\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m,k+1)}$。对 $(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}$，用下式引入一元偏函数 $H_{\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x}$。函数调用的 $\\simeq$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-real-function]]。实变量的替代槽为 $G$ 的最后一个实输入。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-real-function]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-real-function]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"混合元数与层级：[[68-df-baire-space]] → [[68-df-real-machine]] → [[68-df-recursive-real-function]] → [[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]] → [[68-df-projective-hierarchy]] → [[68-thm-separation-theorem]] → [[68-thm-suslin-theorem]]。有限二进制串另记为 $\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$，见 [[68-df-recursive-tree]]，不与 Baire 空间 $\\mathcal B$ 混用。"}],"outgoing":["4bd688e6777d088c","45acd372bb8b9947"]}